---
import Container from "./Container.astro"

---

<div id="presencial-consult">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
      <!-- Left Side - Description -->
      <div>
        <p class="text-primary font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Seção 4</p>
        <h2 class="my-8 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-700 dark:text-white md:text-4xl">
          Treino Presencial
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-lg font-semibold mb-4">Presença que faz a diferença.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Se você prefere o acompanhamento olho a olho, o treino presencial é pra você. Atendo em estúdio particular em São Paulo (Zona Sul), com horários flexíveis e foco total no seu desenvolvimento.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Side - Main Content Card -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 overflow-hidden bg-white dark:bg-gray-800">
      <div class="p-8 md:p-12 space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Por que treinar presencialmente?</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary flex-shrink-0">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.052-.143Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Ideal para quem está começando do zero</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary flex-shrink-0">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.052-.143Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Perfeito para pessoas com condições específicas de saúde</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary flex-shrink-0">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.052-.143Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Energia de treinar ao vivo com foco total</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary flex-shrink-0">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.052-.143Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Cada sessão é planejada e adaptada conforme sua evolução</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Pricing Footer -->
        <div class="pt-8 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-lg">
            <span class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Pacotes a partir de 4 sessões/mês</span>
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm mt-2">Consulte disponibilidade pelo WhatsApp</p>
          
          <div class="mt-6">
            <a
              href="https://wa.me/5514996318482"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center px-8 before:absolute before:inset-0 before:rounded-full before:bg-primary before:transition before:duration-300 hover:before:scale-105 active:duration-75 active:before:scale-95 relative"
            >
              <span class="relative text-base font-semibold text-white">
                Conhecer estúdio
              </span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</div>
